WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.488
VideoComposer is trained on two public datasets:
WebVid-10M,

00:00:04.568 --> 00:00:09.057
about ten million video-caption pairs from the web,
and LAION-400M,

00:00:09.137 --> 00:00:13.625
CLIP-filtered image-caption pairs for visual quality.

00:00:13.705 --> 00:00:18.193
For evaluation,

00:00:18.273 --> 00:00:22.762
the authors report text-to-video on MSR-VTT using
Fréchet Video Distance and CLIP similarity,

00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:27.330
and measure motion controllability on a thousand
caption-video pairs with a dedicated motion-control error.
